. * 1.2 Create event list with non-overlapping windows
. *------------------------------------------------------
. 
. preserve

.     keep dyad_id year shock_ij_year

.     keep if shock_ij_year == 1
(440,479 observations deleted)

.     keep dyad_id year

.     rename year event_year

.     sort dyad_id event_year

. 
